{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "Apereo CAS",
  "abstract": "Open-source enterprise single sign-on server maintained by the Apereo Foundation, built on Java, Spring Boot and Spring Webflow. Speaks CAS, SAML 1.1 and 2.0, WS-Federation, OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect, with multifactor authentication through Duo, FIDO2 WebAuthn, Google Authenticator and others. Authenticates against LDAP, JDBC, X.509, SPNEGO, RADIUS, MongoDB and more, delegates to external SAML, OIDC and social providers, and releases attributes with user consent. Widely used in universities. Self-hosted only under Apache-2.0, with commercial support from third-party vendors.",
